Subject: [PATCH] Add SPHQuant optimization and dense export

Provide spherical vector quantization with configurable direction/radius bit allocation, checkpoint resume, Adam without scheduling, and standard HF dense export. Keep ParoQuant kernel dependencies lazy on the SPHQuant path; leave upstream FP16 training defaults in place.
